Call for Papers

Dear Scientists and Colleagues,
we would like invite you for submission your research to Scientific Virtual 
Conferences. The Virtual Conference is a new type of scientific event, where 
the most of conversation takes place in a text chat, which is prepared for 
each accepted article separately at the conference portal. 

All participants will receive, when the conference is finished: 
* DVD with the conference materials with an ISBN and ISSN numbers.
* All authors and Reviewers will obtain a Conference Certificates. 

Accepted papers will be submitted for evaluation into SCOPUS and other major 
indexing databases.
We would like to create high-quality scientific conferences and place for 
members of the scietific community to share ideas among each other.

